      "kind": "note",
      "text": "A100 SXM 80GB datasheet: BF16/FP16 dense 312 TFLOPS, FP32 non-Tensor 19.5 TFLOPS, HBM 2039 GB/s. FP32 accumulation semantics cross-checked against H100 whitepaper Table 3; its A100 memory column is not used."
